<Placemark><name>Bar Us</name><description>#4 World · #6 Asia · Sukhumvit 26. Three-course &#x27;liquid cuisine&#x27; menu. Tue–Sun 18:00. Reserve.
Price: 500–700 / drink
us-bar.com, first seating on a weeknight. Beef &amp; onion, boiled egg martini, vetiver negroni. Lime next door for tropical fruit cocktails.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=13.7256,100.5694&amp;query_place_id=ChIJG5QaZUKf4jARMm-GbfMbX4A</description><styleUrl>#s-bars</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Bangkok</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>500–700 / drink</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>100.5694,13.7256,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Dry Wave Cocktail Studio</name><description>#27 World · #4 Asia · Thonglor 13, 2F Sodality. Thailand&#x27;s best bar 2026. Daily 19:00–01:00. Reserve.
Price: 450–600
&#x27;What&#x27;s That Sour?&#x27;, &#x27;Tea and Butter&#x27;. Start the Thonglor night here, then Locker Room and Rabbit Hole.

