<Placemark><name>Tep Bar</name><description>CN Traveller · Soi Nana. Ya dong infusions, live traditional Thai music. 18:00–00:00. Book.
Price: 450–600
Band on the ground floor (loud, Mon and Wed especially); 2F for groups who want to talk.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=13.7397,100.5144&amp;query_place_id=ChIJu-y0lCaZ4jARWaSsGSx4nMc</description><styleUrl>#s-bars</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Bangkok</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>450–600</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>100.5144,13.7397,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Teens of Thailand</name><description>Soi Nana · Gin bar behind a low wooden door. 12:00–01:00.
Price: 350–450
Thai tea gin, chrysanthemum G&amp;T. Small; go early.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=13.7399,100.514&amp;query_place_id=ChIJRyBsviaZ4jARj79PNOq0hBI</description><styleUrl>#s-bars</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Bangkok</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>350–450</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>100.514,13.7399,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>The Bamboo Bar</name><description>CN Traveller · Mandarin Oriental. Live jazz since 1953. 17:00–01:00. The proper-shoes night.
Price: 500–700
Mango sticky rice cocktail. Cigar lounge.

