<Placemark><name>Sing Sing Theater</name><description>CN Traveller · Sukhumvit 45. Shanghai-opium-den club, dancing after 23:00. Free entry; book a table.
Price: 350–500
Thu–Sat is the crowd.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=13.7283,100.5735&amp;query_place_id=ChIJQyjXvgCf4jAR062iYhX4elc</description><styleUrl>#s-bars</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Bangkok</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>350–500</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>100.5735,13.7283,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Octave Rooftop</name><description>Rooftop · Marriott Sukhumvit 57, 45–49F. Happy hour 17:00–19:00 half price. Sunset 18:15.
Price: 370–450
DJ from 20:00. Reserve for the top deck; 1,800 minimum on busy nights.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=13.7235,100.5805&amp;query_place_id=ChIJhxshNqWf4jARgYxEW8hBGcE</description><styleUrl>#s-bars</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Bangkok</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>370–450</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>100.5805,13.7235,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
