<Placemark><name>Sala Saneha</name><description>Best new bar 2026 · Soi Decho, Silom. Wine bar + tiny cinema + bookstore in a heritage house. Closed Tue.
Price: 300–500
For the film crew. 18:00–00:00; from 11:00 on weekends.

