<Folder><name>Phuket · nights</name>
<Placemark><name>Illuzion, Bangla Road</name><description>#9 DJ Mag clubs · 21:00–04:00. Free to 2,000 entry; 1,200 open-bar pass. 20+ with ID.
Price: 1,000–2,500 / night
Also on Bangla: Sugar Club (hip-hop), Armania, Skylight Rooftop. Beer 100–180, cocktails 200–350. Ignore the touts. Tables from ~8,000.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.8934,98.2977&amp;query_place_id=ChIJA4Aqqbw6UDARcgkqgvpCe7I</description><styleUrl>#s-nights</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>1,000–2,500 / night</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.2977,7.8934,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Catch Beach Club, Bang Tao</name><description>Beach club · On your beach. Arrive 15:00, stay through sunset and the fire show. 07:30–00:00.
Price: 1,500 bed
Cabanas from 3,000 part-credited. Book beds in advance. +66 65 348 2017.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.989,98.2892&amp;query_place_id=ChIJH6s1-5A5UDARH6VeybNnz84</description><styleUrl>#s-nights</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>1,500 bed</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.2892,7.989,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Café del Mar, Kamala</name><description>#37 DJ Mag · Club nights Wed–Sat after 22:00. Saturday after Catch.
Price: 1,500–3,000 min
11:00–00:00. Fire and red-light night mode after dark.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.961,98.2839&amp;query_place_id=ChIJcTtP-SA6UDAR2ObfmKVl7Wo</description><styleUrl>#s-nights</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>1,500–3,000 min</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.2839,7.961,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Baba Nest, Sri Panwa</name><description>Sunset · Rooftop ringed by an infinity pool, Cape Panwa. 17:00–20:00. Book and prepay days ahead.
Price: 2,000–3,000 min
Mexican-leaning food. Skip if cloudy. +66 76 371 000.

