<Placemark><name>Club No. 43</name><description>Old Town · Phuket&#x27;s first mixology bar. Quiet, precise. 18:00–00:00.
Price: 300–400
Order the Sakura. Snacks only.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.8844,98.3873&amp;query_place_id=ChIJrU0u7PoxUDARipcI9qY4vak</description><styleUrl>#s-nights</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>300–400</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.3873,7.8844,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
