<Folder><name>Beaches, sunsets, airports</name>
<Placemark><name>Promthep Cape</name><description>The classic sunset, but 55 min from Bang Tao. Only if you&#x27;re already south. Car park full by 17:30.
Price: Free; parking 20
Walk 8 min out to the cape tip for the quiet spot.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.7618,98.3053&amp;query_place_id=ChIJtZgCJiEmUDARG1q53LLQaAs</description><styleUrl>#s-spots</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>Free; parking 20</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.3053,7.7618,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Windmill Viewpoint</name><description>Three minutes from Promthep, half the crowd. Arrive by 16:30.
Price: Free
Parking for ~15 cars; roadside works.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.7697,98.3064&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ2fW0mh8mUDARF9QBYA9rLks</description><styleUrl>#s-spots</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>Free</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.3064,7.7697,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Nai Harn Beach</name><description>Calmest swim in late November, but 55 min south. Surin and Bang Tao are your home beaches now.
Price: Loungers 100–200
Kiteboarding Asia is ten minutes away in Rawai.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.7812,98.3117&amp;query_place_id=ChIJv_ZCThwmUDARIcYFtxtWJX4</description><styleUrl>#s-spots</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>Loungers 100–200</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.3117,7.7812,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Surin Beach</name><description>Five minutes south of Bang Tao. Cleaner water than Bang Tao itself, no beach clubs, good sunset.
Price: Free
Laem Singh viewpoint is just past it on the Kamala road.

Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.9735,98.278</description><styleUrl>#s-spots</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="city"><value>Phuket</value></Data><Data name="price"><value>Free</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>98.278,7.9735,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kata Noi Beach</name><description>Cleaner, quieter than Kata. Hillside sunset bars. Longtails to Freedom Beach from the left end.
Price: Free
Surf House Kata is a ten-minute walk north.

