<Placemark><name>Phuket Airport (HKT)</name><description>Thu 19 arrival 10:00; Tue 24 departures. 45–60 min to Kata/Patong, 30 to Old Town.
Price: —
Ride-hailing pickups are a short walk from the terminal.

